      "content": "i feel like im losing my mind lately but i think i finally figured out why i never fit in here. i've been digging through these old family archives and some stuff just doesn't add up... the dates, the migration patterns, everything points to us not actually being from here. i think my family is part of those pre-earth voyagers people talk about. like, we're actually meant to be leading the way to mars and that's why earth feels so wrong. how do i even begin to act like someone who knows their true importance when everyone around me is so... ordinary?",
